README for the bunsen-archive-keyring package
=============================================

The BunsenLabs project signs its Release files that are stored on the
package server with the keys contained in this package.

Each actively used .pgp key is placed in /usr/share/keyrings/ along with a symlink
from the corresponding .gpg filename.

The signatures of acquired Release files are checked against this key database.

IMPORTANT NOTE:

Equivalent armored .asc files are installed to /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/
but this will cease with the BunsenLabs Nitrogen release. 
By then, users should make sure that their apt sources have a
"Signed-By" entry pointing to the .pgp file in /usr/share/keyrings/
 
